OL,3,GNEWSACancelled carnival will be back in
OL,4,A2027 - organisers
OL,5,
OL,6,FA carnival with more than 120 years of
OL,7,Fhistory will return, organisers say,
OL,8,Fafter being cancelled this year due to
OL,9,Fa lack of funding.
OL,11,FTrowbridge Carnival in Wiltshire
OL,12,Fattracts between 10,000 and 12,000
OL,13,Fpeople every year and costs about
OL,14,F#12,000 to #13,000 to put on, president
OL,15,FAndy Barlow said.
OL,17,FThis year's event, which was due to
OL,18,Ftake place in October, was cancelled as
OL,19,Forganisers said it became "impossible"
OL,20,Fto raise enough money to stage the
OL,21,Fprocession safely.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,350,340,200,160,0,100
