OL,3,GNEWSACancelled carnival will be back in
OL,4,A2027 - organisers
OL,5,
OL,6,FBarlow has now said the carnival will
OL,7,Freturn "without any shadow of a doubt"
OL,8,F- but fundraising would need to come
OL,9,Ffrom local businesses and the "good
OL,10,Ffolk of Trowbridge".
